      "parameters": {
        "content": "WEEKLY FEEDBACK SYNTHESIS\n\n1) Point 'Pull feedback' at your sources (helpdesk/reviews/survey export).\n2) Set the Anthropic credential.\n3) Swap the NoOp for your Slack/Docs node.\n4) Don't over-generalise from a few loud voices — the prompt sizes each theme.",
        "height": 320,
